@fg-lab/amadeus-persona README · Install and configure：Install the prebuilt `.tgz` with the official DSH plugin manager into your selected Profile. No local source build is required. Follow [installation instructions](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md); do not copy configuration into a running Profile by hand.

Open the Persona console, bind one Workspace, save your own core card and optionally create styles and bindings. An empty install imposes no persona.

The other Amadeus plugins are optional. Install only the integrations you need.

@fg-lab/amadeus-persona README · 安装与首次配置：使用官方 DSH 插件管理器将预构建 `.tgz` 安装到所需 Profile，无需手工构建源码。按[安装说明](docs/INSTALL_V1_2.md)操作，不要手工改写正在运行的 Profile。

打开人格控制台、绑定一个工作区、保存自己的核心人格，再按需建立风格与绑定。空白安装不会强加人格。

其他 Amadeus 插件均为可选联动，按需要分别安装。
